   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Just back transform to get mirt&#39;s parametrization and use those in simdata instead. a=a, d=-a*b, g=c. There&#39;s also an undocumented internal function mirt:::traditional2mirt who&#39;s source code made be helpful. Cheers. </div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Phil</span><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
